  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">egg salad sandwich feels like a cozy afternoon chat, blending creamy mayo, tangy Dijon mustard, and a touch of apple cider vinegar. Roughly chopped hard-boiled eggs toss with bright lemon juice, crisp celery, and fresh chives for lift. A sneaky dash of pickled cucumber adds zing before you tuck it between buttered sourdough or sturdy whole grain. Top with lettuce and a light sprinkle of smoked paprika, and every bite tastes like sunshine. This playful twist on a classic turns lunch into pure joy and makes you the hero of your kitchen.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-egg-salad-sandwich\">Why You’ll Love This egg salad sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-an-amazing-egg-salad-sandwich\">How to Make an Amazing Egg Salad Sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-egg-salad-sandwich\">Pro Tips for Making egg salad sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-egg-salad-sandwich\">How to Serve this egg salad sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-egg-salad-sandwich\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This egg salad sandwich</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s creamy and satisfying, perfect for any meal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick to prepare, making it a great last-minute option.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile—enjoy it on bread, crackers, or lettuce wraps.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with protein to keep you energized throughout the day.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite herbs and spices for a personal touch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-con